@startuml
==Instance creation==
Dev->"LB controller": Create an instance in this zone with these resources
"LB controller"->GIVE: Orders the creation of a VM with this info \n(instance-id and connection info of the controller)
"LB controller"->Dev: Your instance is being created
"LB controller"->Dev: Your instance is being created
loop until create
  Dev->"LB controller": Is the instance created?
end
==VIP creation==
Dev->"LB controller": Can I have a vip?
"LB controller"->"Ref IP": Can I have an IP from the LB pool?
"Ref IP"->"LB controller": Here is the ip 10.x.x.x
"LB controller"->Dev: Here is your vip, you can use it now
==l4/l7 LB creation==
Dev->"LB controller": Here is my vip, I would like load balancing on \nthis port to this backend address, with healthcheck
"LB controller"->Dev: I record your request and create \na revision so your nodes get the info
@enduml
